        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Virgo &mdash; 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p><em>Clarity of Mind &mdash; the wheel of dharma turning, clarity offered outward.</em></p><p>You and your allies in the emanation gain a <strong>+1 status bonus to Will saves and to saves against mental effects</strong>, and are <strong>immune to the fascinated and frightened conditions</strong>.</p><p>When you cast this Technique, you may counteract one mental effect currently affecting a creature in the area, using your Cosmo DC.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The emanation increases by 5 feet. At 12th level the bonus becomes +2 and the immunity extends to <strong>confused</strong>; at 18th level the bonus becomes +3.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
